{"id": "|C1701E2146D86662C88C5EAE40992116", "source_en": "Press <IA_AngelMode_UI_Only/> to activate Angel Ascension.\n\nAngel Ascension provides heightened powers, defense, abilities, and cleanses all negative effects.\n\nUse Angel Ascension now to vanquish enemies.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_AngelMode_UI_Only/> لتفعيل الصعود الملائكي.\n\nيمنحك الصعود الملائكي قوى دفاعية وقدرات معززة، كما يطهر جميع التأثيرات السلبية.\n\nاستخدم الصعود الملائكي الآن لهزيمة الأعداء.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
{"id": "|0E91B0E947B6F7793FDD89B72BD3E713", "source_en": "Press <IA_AngelSense/> to activate Angel Sense and reveal hidden enemies and gate locations.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_AngelSense/> لتفعيل حاسة الملاك وكشف الأعداء المخفيين ومواقع البوابات.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
{"id": "|62DB6C1D463267C7CD51C39CAD099D33", "source_en": "Press <IA_Attack/> for a Light Attack.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_Attack/> لشن هجوم خفيف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
{"id": "|E6CB35A04F2A2A322C5543AFF6792652", "source_en": "Press <IA_CycleRightHandItems/> to Swap to your 2-Handed Weapon.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_CycleRightHandItems/> للتبديل إلى سلاحك ذي اليدين.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
{"id": "|4514669749E248598E9562B1F203D93E", "source_en": "Press <IA_Dodge/> to Dodge. \n\nPress <IA_Move/> + <IA_Dodge/> to dodge directionally while locked-on.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_Dodge/> للمراوغة. \n\nاضغط <IA_Move/> + <IA_Dodge/> للمراوغة في اتجاه معين أثناء قفل الهدف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
{"id": "|39C3E4164805B3717E6F699EE92E3282", "source_en": "Press <IA_HealthFlask/> to use a healing flask.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_HealthFlask/> لاستخدام قارورة علاج.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
{"id": "|2BC97B3341AE639746EA02908C7EE17D", "source_en": "Press <IA_HeavyAttack/> for a Heavy attack.\n\nHold <IA_HeavyAttack/> for a Heavy Charge attack.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_HeavyAttack/> للقيام بهجوم ثقيل. \n\nاستمر في الضغط على <IA_HeavyAttack/> للقيام بهجوم ثقيل مشحون.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
{"id": "|71DD61974DFA72BB7974AD9F72EDE340", "source_en": "Press <IA_Jump/> to Jump.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_Jump/> للقفز.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
{"id": "|F3E2BE7A48F1FCFC25EFD5AE97705620", "source_en": "Press <IA_Parry/> just before an attack lands to parry an enemy's attack.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_Parry/> قبل وصول هجوم العدو مباشرة لصدّ هجومه.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
{"id": "|8514E3A5467FB2A008F9F098446DDE23", "source_en": "Press <IA_Targeting/> to Lock-On.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "اضغط <IA_Targeting/> لقفل الهدف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 28}}
